  </p>
  <div class="st-grid st-g2 st-wide">
    <div class="pcard rv">
      <p class="pcard__word">Learning</p>
      <h3 class="pcard__title">Build the happy path</h3>
      <p class="pcard__text">How to create a happy path, and design its errors alongside it.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="pcard rv">
      <p class="pcard__word">Growth</p>
      <h3 class="pcard__title">Aesthetics, hierarchy and usability</h3>
